    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: a Friend 'Squad' (Man Leader + Man 1-3) at (58-70, 80) marches east to (185, 80) with DangerAreas on. 'Field B', an own anti-personnel field Friend knows from the start (KnownAtStartSides), lies across the way at (130-150, 50-110). The march's route sensor reports it as a Minefield danger area; it is never crossed as a drill - the squad's SOP halts it (the MinefieldAhead reaction pauses the march), every man holds, and it calls the engineers (CE-4624 MS-B4, Minefields KG-7, R-2127). Judge: (1) the squad marches; (2) it reacts MinefieldAhead, short of the field - within 30 m along its route, so the leader ends at x >= 90, not where it started; (3) nobody enters the field (x stays below 130); (4) no mine goes off and nobody is hurt; (5) the squad is still halted at the end. Fail: the squad walks into the field, a blast, or the crossing drill. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh mf-no-way-round"
  },
